    "body": "#cloud-config\n# RAM must exceed the full ISO size plus installer working memory: url= downloads the ISO into RAM.\n# Layer7 qualification must size the VM from the actual ISO, not a fixed universal minimum.\nautoinstall:\n  version: 1\n  locale: en_US.UTF-8\n  keyboard:\n    layout: us\n  timezone: UTC\n  {{slot:partition}}\n  {{slot:network}}\n  identity:\n    hostname: '{{param:hostname}}'\n    {{slot:account}}\n  {{slot:sshkey}}\n  packages:\n    {{slot:packages}}\n  late-commands:\n    - {{lober:firstboot}}\n    - {{lober:cleanup}}\n",
